{"seq":1,"slug":"rtos-fundamentals","title":"RTOS 基础原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/rtos-and-scheduling/rtos-fundamentals","wordCount":879,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"rtos-基础原理\">RTOS 基础原理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>实时操作系统（Real-Time Operating System, RTOS）是专为嵌入式系统设计的轻量级操作系统内核，核心职责是任务调度、资源管理和时间确定性保证。与通用操作系统（Linux/Windows）追求吞吐量不同，RTOS 追求的是可预测的响应时间——在硬实时系统中，错过截止时间等同于系统失败。理解 RTOS 的任务模型、调度机制和同步原语，是构建可靠嵌入式系统的关键。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[RTOS 核心] --&gt; B[任务管理]&#10;    A --&gt; C[调度器]&#10;    A --&gt; D[同步与通信]&#10;    A --&gt; E[内存管理]&#10;    A --&gt; F[时间管理]&#10;    B --&gt; G[任务创建/删除]&#10;    B --&gt; H[任务状态转换]&#10;    C --&gt; I[优先级调度]&#10;    C --&gt; J[时间片轮转]&#10;    D --&gt; K[信号量]&#10;    D --&gt; L[互斥量]&#10;    D --&gt; M[消息队列]\">graph TD\n    A[RTOS 核心] --&gt; B[任务管理]\n    A --&gt; C[调度器]\n    A --&gt; D[同步与通信]\n    A --&gt; E[内存管理]\n    A --&gt; F[时间管理]\n    B --&gt; G[任务创建/删除]\n    B --&gt; H[任务状态转换]\n    C --&gt; I[优先级调度]\n    C --&gt; J[时间片轮转]\n    D --&gt; K[信号量]\n    D --&gt; L[互斥量]\n    D --&gt; M[消息队列]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>裸机（Super Loop）</th>\n<th>RTOS</th>\n<th>Linux</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>调度方式</td>\n<td>轮询</td>\n<td>抢占式优先级</td>\n<td>时间片 + CFS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>响应延迟</td>\n<td>取决于循环周期</td>\n<td>微秒级确定性</td>\n<td>毫秒级不确定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存开销</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>2-10KB</td>\n<td>MB 级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任务隔离</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>栈隔离</td>\n<td>进程隔离 + MMU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同步机制</td>\n<td>全局变量/标志</td>\n<td>信号量/互斥量/队列</td>\n<td>完整 IPC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适用场景</td>\n<td>简单控制</td>\n<td>中等复杂度</td>\n<td>复杂应用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"任务状态模型\">任务状态模型</h2><p>RTOS 中的任务（Task/Thread）有明确的状态转换模型。调度器根据任务的当前状态和优先级决定哪个任务获得 CPU 时间：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// FreeRTOS 任务创建&#10;TaskHandle_t sensorTask;&#10;xTaskCreate(&#10;    sensorTaskFunc,      // 任务函数&#10;    &quot;Sensor&quot;,            // 任务名（调试用）&#10;    256,                 // 栈大小（words）&#10;    NULL,                // 参数&#10;    2,                   // 优先级（数字越大越高）&#10;    &amp;sensorTask          // 任务句柄&#10;);&#10;&#10;void sensorTaskFunc(void *pvParameters) {&#10;    while (1) {&#10;        readSensor();&#10;        processData();&#10;        vTaskDelay(pdMS_TO_TICKS(100));  // 释放 CPU 100ms&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// FreeRTOS 任务创建</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">TaskHandle_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sensorTask;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xTaskCreate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sensorTaskFunc,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 任务函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Sensor\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">            // 任务名（调试用）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                 // 栈大小（words）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                // 参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                   // 优先级（数字越大越高）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">sensorTask</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // 任务句柄</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sensorTaskFunc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">pvParameters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        readSensor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        processData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        vTaskDelay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pdMS_TO_TICKS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 释放 CPU 100ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[就绪 Ready] --&gt;|被调度器选中| B[运行 Running]&#10;    B --&gt;|更高优先级就绪| A&#10;    B --&gt;|等待事件/延时| C[阻塞 Blocked]&#10;    C --&gt;|事件到达/超时| A&#10;    B --&gt;|挂起 API| D[挂起 Suspended]&#10;    D --&gt;|恢复 API| A&#10;    A --&gt;|挂起 API| D\">graph LR\n    A[就绪 Ready] --&gt;|被调度器选中| B[运行 Running]\n    B --&gt;|更高优先级就绪| A\n    B --&gt;|等待事件/延时| C[阻塞 Blocked]\n    C --&gt;|事件到达/超时| A\n    B --&gt;|挂起 API| D[挂起 Suspended]\n    D --&gt;|恢复 API| A\n    A --&gt;|挂起 API| D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Running</td>\n<td>正在执行</td>\n<td>被调度器选中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ready</td>\n<td>可执行，等待调度</td>\n<td>被抢占、创建后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Blocked</td>\n<td>等待事件或延时</td>\n<td>vTaskDelay、xQueueReceive</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Suspended</td>\n<td>被显式挂起</td>\n<td>vTaskSuspend 调用</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"同步与通信原语\">同步与通信原语</h2><h3 id=\"信号量与互斥量\">信号量与互斥量</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 二值信号量：ISR → 任务 的事件通知&#10;SemaphoreHandle_t uartSem = xSemaphoreCreateBinary();&#10;&#10;void USART1_IRQHandler(void) {&#10;    BaseType_t xHigherPriorityTaskWoken = pdFALSE;&#10;    xSemaphoreGiveFromISR(uartSem, &amp;xHigherPriorityTaskWoken);&#10;    portYIELD_FROM_ISR(xHigherPriorityTaskWoken);&#10;}&#10;&#10;void uartTask(void *p) {&#10;    while (1) {&#10;        xSemaphoreTake(uartSem, portMAX_DELAY);&#10;        processUartData();&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 互斥量：保护共享资源（支持优先级继承）&#10;SemaphoreHandle_t spiMutex = xSemaphoreCreateMutex();&#10;&#10;void spiTransfer(uint8_t *data, size_t len) {&#10;    xSemaphoreTake(spiMutex, portMAX_DELAY);&#10;    HAL_SPI_Transmit(&amp;hspi1, data, len, 1000);&#10;    xSemaphoreGive(spiMutex);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 二值信号量：ISR → 任务 的事件通知</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SemaphoreHandle_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uartSem </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xSemaphoreCreateBinary</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> USART1_IRQHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    BaseType_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> xHigherPriorityTaskWoken </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pdFALSE;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    xSemaphoreGiveFromISR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(uartSem, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">xHigherPriorityTaskWoken);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    portYIELD_FROM_ISR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(xHigherPriorityTaskWoken);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uartTask</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        xSemaphoreTake</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(uartSem, portMAX_DELAY);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        processUartData</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 互斥量：保护共享资源（支持优先级继承）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SemaphoreHandle_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> spiMutex </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xSemaphoreCreateMutex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> spiTransfer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">data</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">size_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    xSemaphoreTake</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(spiMutex, portMAX_DELAY);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    HAL_SPI_Transmit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">hspi1, data, len, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    xSemaphoreGive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(spiMutex);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"消息队列\">消息队列</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 消息队列：任务间类型安全的数据传递&#10;typedef struct {&#10;    uint16_t sensorId;&#10;    float value;&#10;    uint32_t timestamp;&#10;} SensorReading;&#10;&#10;QueueHandle_t sensorQueue = xQueueCreate(10, sizeof(SensorReading));&#10;&#10;void sensorTask(void *p) {&#10;    while (1) {&#10;        SensorReading reading = {&#10;            .sensorId = 1,&#10;            .value = readTemperature(),&#10;            .timestamp = xTaskGetTickCount()&#10;        };&#10;        xQueueSend(sensorQueue, &amp;reading, pdMS_TO_TICKS(100));&#10;        vTaskDelay(pdMS_TO_TICKS(500));&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;void processingTask(void *p) {&#10;    SensorReading reading;&#10;    while (1) {&#10;        if (xQueueReceive(sensorQueue, &amp;reading, portMAX_DELAY) == pdTRUE) {&#10;            logReading(&amp;reading);&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 消息队列：任务间类型安全的数据传递</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">typedef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint16_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sensorId;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    float</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> value;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> timestamp;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} SensorReading;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">QueueHandle_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sensorQueue </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xQueueCreate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">sizeof</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(SensorReading));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sensorTask</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        SensorReading reading </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .sensorId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .value </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> readTemperature</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            .timestamp </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> xTaskGetTickCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        xQueueSend</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sensorQueue, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">reading, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pdMS_TO_TICKS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        vTaskDelay</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pdMS_TO_TICKS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> processingTask</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    SensorReading reading;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">xQueueReceive</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(sensorQueue, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">reading, portMAX_DELAY) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pdTRUE) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">            logReading</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">reading);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>同步原语</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>ISR 安全</th>\n<th>优先级继承</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>二值信号量</td>\n<td>事件通知</td>\n<td>是（FromISR）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计数信号量</td>\n<td>资源计数</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互斥量</td>\n<td>共享资源保护</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>消息队列</td>\n<td>数据传递</td>\n<td>是（FromISR）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>事件组</td>\n<td>多事件等待</td>\n<td>是（部分）</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任务通知</td>\n<td>轻量级通知</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"优先级反转与继承\">优先级反转与继承</h2><p>优先级反转是 RTOS 中的经典问题——低优先级任务持有高优先级任务需要的互斥量，而中优先级任务抢占了低优先级任务，导致高优先级任务间接被中优先级任务阻塞：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 优先级反转场景：&#10;// 高优先级任务 H 等待互斥量 M&#10;// 低优先级任务 L 持有 M&#10;// 中优先级任务 M 抢占 L&#10;// → H 被 M 间接阻塞（反转）&#10;&#10;// 解决方案：优先级继承&#10;// FreeRTOS 的 xSemaphoreCreateMutex() 自动支持&#10;// 当 H 等待 L 持有的互斥量时，L 临时提升到 H 的优先级\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 优先级反转场景：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 高优先级任务 H 等待互斥量 M</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 低优先级任务 L 持有 M</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 中优先级任务 M 抢占 L</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// → H 被 M 间接阻塞（反转）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 解决方案：优先级继承</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// FreeRTOS 的 xSemaphoreCreateMutex() 自动支持</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 当 H 等待 L 持有的互斥量时，L 临时提升到 H 的优先级</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解决方案</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>开销</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>优先级继承</td>\n<td>临时提升持有者优先级</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>通用（FreeRTOS 默认）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>优先级天花板</td>\n<td>预设互斥量最高优先级</td>\n<td>更低</td>\n<td>已知所有使用者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>禁止中断</td>\n<td>禁止所有中断</td>\n<td>零调度</td>\n<td>极短临界区</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"rtos-内存管理策略\">RTOS 内存管理策略</h2><p>FreeRTOS 提供了 5 种内存分配策略，适应不同的嵌入式场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>碎片化</th>\n<th>释放</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>heap_1</td>\n<td>只分配不释放</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>不支持</td>\n<td>创建后不删除的任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>heap_2</td>\n<td>最佳匹配</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>固定大小的分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>heap_3</td>\n<td>包装 malloc/free</td>\n<td>取决于实现</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>已有 libc 的项目</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>heap_4</td>\n<td>首次匹配 + 合并</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>通用推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>heap_5</td>\n<td>heap_4 + 非连续内存</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>多 RAM 区域</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RTOS 的核心价值是确定性的任务调度和微秒级的响应延迟</li>\n<li>任务有 Running、Ready、Blocked、Suspended 四种状态，调度器始终运行最高优先级的就绪任务</li>\n<li>二值信号量用于 ISR→任务的事件通知，互斥量用于共享资源保护（支持优先级继承）</li>\n<li>消息队列是任务间传递数据的标准方式，比全局变量更安全</li>\n<li>优先级反转通过优先级继承或天花板协议解决</li>\n<li>FreeRTOS 的 heap_4 是通用推荐的内存分配策略，兼顾灵活性和碎片控制</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"RTOS 基础原理","id":"rtos-基础原理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"任务状态模型","id":"任务状态模型"},{"level":2,"text":"同步与通信原语","id":"同步与通信原语"},{"level":3,"text":"信号量与互斥量","id":"信号量与互斥量"},{"level":3,"text":"消息队列","id":"消息队列"},{"level":2,"text":"优先级反转与继承","id":"优先级反转与继承"},{"level":2,"text":"RTOS 内存管理策略","id":"rtos-内存管理策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"中断与定时器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/embedded-fundamentals/interrupt-and-timer"},"next":{"title":"FreeRTOS 实战","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/rtos-and-scheduling/freertos-in-practice"}}